      "lines": [
        "§1. 数学归纳法原理及其应用"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "h3",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "1. 完全归纳法和不完全归纳法的概念"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "从若干个特殊事例得出某种一般的结论的推理方法叫做",
        "归纳法．例如，当变量$n$取$1,2,3,\\cdots$等不同的数值时，连加",
        "奇数$1,3,5,7,\\cdots,2n-1$，得*："
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$1=1=1^2$；",
        "$1+3=4=2^2$；",
        "$1+3+5=9=3^2$；",
        "$1+3+5+7=16=4^2$；",
        "$1+3+5+7+9=25=5^2$．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "从上面所举的例子，不难看出，前几个奇数的和等于加数",
        "的个数的平方．很自然会想到这样的结论：这个性质对任意",
        "多个加数都成立．我们的推测（假设）可以叙述如下：“对于所",
        "有自然数$n$，等式"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$1+3+5+\\cdots+(2n-1)=n^2$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "成立”．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "由此可见，所讨论的五个事例“启发了”我们作出假设，而"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "foot",
      "label": "note",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "* 在第一行里有“由一个加数构成的和”．把由一个加数构成的和包括在",
        "“和”这个词里，这样理解“和”，在数学中有时有用．"
      ]
    },
